{
  "name": "Product description writer for a Google Sheet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 6
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "77b2d6d5-739d-5478-a382-40d1288a48af",
      "name": "Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "raw",
        "jsonOutput": "{\n  \"config\": {\n    \"sheet_url\": \"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_SHEET_ID/edit\",\n    \"sheet_tab\": \"Products\",\n    \"owner_email\": \"you@example.com\",\n    \"business_name\": \"Your Business\",\n    \"sender_name\": \"Your Name\",\n    \"rows_per_run\": 20\n  }\n}",
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "dbfc4cec-028a-5f16-9801-c9b4b147851f",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.sheet_url }}"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.sheet_tab }}"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f27be992-e296-5b7a-b31c-9a6a9c31d53a",
      "name": "Read rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const cfg = $('Settings').first().json.config;\nconst has = (v) => v !== undefined && v !== null && String(v).trim() !== '';\nreturn $input.all().filter((i) => has(i.json.product_name) && has(i.json.features) && !has(i.json[\"description\"])).slice(0, Number(cfg.rows_per_run));"
      },
      "id": "05f97c4b-cd2a-5ad7-83c7-5066eb0eaf43",
      "name": "Find rows to fill in",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Write a friendly 60-word product description for {{ $json.product_name }}. Features: {{ $json.features }}. No hype, no made-up facts.",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "id": "e594d67d-87bd-5d0c-8387-199899d9b3c5",
      "name": "AI: fill in the row",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-5-mini",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-5-mini"
        },
        "responsesApiEnabled": false,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "fdcd0fbf-777e-5a5d-992f-1b302845c9ed",
      "name": "AI model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        960,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\n  \"description\": \"Short description\"\n}"
      },
      "id": "0e5911ee-64db-5273-a00f-66210272656f",
      "name": "AI output format",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1160,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return $input.all().map((item, i) => ({ json: { row_number: $('Find rows to fill in').all()[i].json.row_number, ...item.json.output } }));"
      },
      "id": "e97edf41-33bb-5204-85ff-13b641c3be86",
      "name": "Match results to rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.sheet_url }}"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.sheet_tab }}"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": [
            "row_number"
          ],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {
          "cellFormat": "RAW",
          "handlingExtraData": "ignoreIt"
        }
      },
      "id": "6f01bd7a-b8b4-5704-b95d-b064ef48c23b",
      "name": "Write back to the sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        1440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Product description writer for a Google Sheet\nFinds products without a description in your sheet and writes one with AI. Review before publishing.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "28272bb7-8e4e-5ec1-8973-b76a44d95ce5",
      "name": "Note: what this does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Use a Google Sheet with a tab named **Products** and these headers in row 1 (see `sheet-headers.csv`).\n2. Fill the input columns (product_name, features). Leave description empty: the AI fills it.\n3. Open **Settings**: sheet URL and how many rows to process per run.\n4. Connect Google Sheets and OpenAI on the nodes with warnings.\n5. Run once by hand, check the results, then switch to **Active**. It only touches rows where description is empty.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "2633659c-bf08-509b-8ac3-16e812cbb70a",
      "name": "Note: setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        400,
        -400
      ]
    }
